  "title": "Jointed Crunchy Mexican Nectarines Iron-Teppan Salad",
  "description": "A festive mexican dish featuring nectarines, papillote, and a lacto-vegetarian-friendly topping on an iron-teppan plate for a salty, crunchy meal.",
