  "instructions": [
    "Slice the nectarine into quarters, removing seeds.",
    "Core the baby kale leaves and wash them thoroughly under running water.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together lime juice, olive oil, salt, and pepper. Set aside.",
    "Tear or cut the papillote into pieces to serve as a topping.",
    "On your iron-teppan plate, start by laying out the sliced nectarine quarters in an artistic pattern.",
    "Top each quarter with a few baby kale leaves and some of the finely chopped red onion.",
    "Sprinkle on the slivered almonds for added crunch and texture.",
    "Drizzle the lime dressing over all ingredients.",
